{
  "bodyHash": "Sl+uq4OPZCM=",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:&amp;#x27\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner-slim.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过Crowdin翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\n沉浸式护甲为游戏增添了许多贴近原版且独特的护甲套装。与枯燥的复制粘贴式护甲不同，沉浸式护甲专注于视觉增强的护甲，有些还带有披风或自定义模型。大多数提供专属效果，如狂战士模式、反弹、尖刺、神圣庇护等。合成配方已正确注册到原版合成书中。附魔、修复、染色等功能均正常工作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>40种新护甲物品，数量还在增加！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_armors:armor&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的图谱图片\"></p><p></p>\n\n<h1>木质护甲</h1>\n<p>不知道你怎么想，但我已经厌倦了被骷髅射手偷袭。这种原始但有效的护甲提供相当不错的箭矢和爆炸保护。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髅护甲</h1>\n<p>有没有想过把敌人变成护甲？大概没有，但这是一套轻量级的骷髅护甲。能让你移动更快，甚至包括凋零护甲。骷髅不再攻击你。伤害所有试图触碰你的生物！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神圣护甲</h1>\n<p>想脱颖而出？给你，一套华丽的红金护甲。随意给布料染上你喜欢的颜色。除了外观漂亮和拥有超高的防护值外，全套神圣护甲每分钟能完全阻挡一次攻击！</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型护甲</h1>\n<p>高护甲、高韧性、几乎无击退，但牺牲了机动性。这套护甲专为碾压最强敌人而设计。</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史莱姆护甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道，这看起来不像护甲。但相信我，它确实有效。攻击你的敌人会被弹开，爆炸也不会那么疼了！不过穿上后可能会有点味道……</p>\n<img width=\"300\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>战士护甲</h1>\n<p>它不只是维京护甲，穿上它，你就是维京人！造成更多斧头伤害，并且每缺失一点生命值就增加整体伤害。进入狂战士模式，在残酷的近战中屠戮敌人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>长袍护甲</h1>\n<p>柔软、可染色的羊毛护甲。注入烈焰棒，对所有攻击你的敌人造成火焰伤害！哦，它还防火。因为烈焰棒。科学！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽朋克护甲</h1>\n<p>旋转的齿轮、黄铜、指南针、时钟，还有大量烟雾。让我为你介绍最复杂的护甲套装——蒸汽朋克护甲。头盔配有潜行时激活的敌意雷达系统。胸甲提供增强的界面，让你再也不会忘记时间！护腿配备二段跳，靴子通过内置蒸汽喷射完全防止坠落伤害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶护甲</h1>\n<p>利用守卫者的尖刺为你所用！这套尖刺护甲会对攻击者造成尖刺伤害。虽然坚固的岩石会降低你的速度，但它也提供了深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>视频评测！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size:16px;text-align:center;font-family:&amp;#x27\">\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品都集成在原版合成书中（以及任何类似JEI的模组）。骨头、铁块、海晶碎片、羊毛、粘液球、活塞、皮革护甲、长袍、凋零骷髅头颅和木头是解锁配方所需的物品。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_armors:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=16&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方图片\"></p><p></p>\n\n<h1>翻译</h1>\n<p>\n沉浸式护甲已通过机器翻译支持多种语言，但由于质量往往较差，欢迎您通过\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>加入翻译工作。\n<br>\n欢迎给差评的翻译投反对票，并提交您自己的版本。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不兼容</h1>\n<p>史诗战斗模组（护甲将使用丑陋的备用模型）</p>\n<p>尝试以降低透明度渲染护甲的模组</p>\n\n<h1>集成</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-humans\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile Humans&amp;description=向你的世界添加带有结构的敌对人类&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"敌对人类\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=大量独特且忠于原版的护甲套装。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式护甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=一系列用于旅行、运输和探索的怀旧飞行器！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=在各种乐器上演奏自定义旋律，骚扰你的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=拖放、像素化并挂起美丽的艺术品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式画作\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=一个轻量级实体刻调度器，使你的TPS翻倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式优化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=在不相关时隐藏丑陋的方块选择轮廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"选择性边界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=为沉浸式飞行器设计的一套额外飞行器，考虑到了机械动力模组支持。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"多型飞机\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=一系列用于运输、采矿和自动化的怀旧机械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式机械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description=在游戏中创建自定义精美的家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=散布在主世界的神秘、被遗忘已久的传送门。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式传送门\">\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜欢颜色？部分护甲套装是可染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\" alt=\"截图\">\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n截图中的光影是怀旧光影\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=4c21d6df030e3633f0c59639a39f2560\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希值。\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
